<title>GERMANY: Sixt plans one-for-four free share issue.</title>
<headline>Sixt plans one-for-four free share issue.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car rental company Sixt AG said on Thursday it planned to make a one-for-four issue of free shares in a move which would raise its equity capital by 5.4 million marks to 27 million marks nominal.</p>
<p>The company also said in a regulatory statement that its shares would be converted to five-mark nominal units. The company will also convert 4.6 million marks nominal of preferred shares into ordinary stock.</p>
</text>
